WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.674
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.343
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:14.313 --> 00:16.314
Goodbye, Big Brother Kouhei...

00:16.315 --> 00:18.776
My big bro... Onii-chan!

00:21.487 --> 00:22.987
My family runs an inn.

00:22.988 --> 00:24.906
Are you my big brother's girlfriend?

00:24.907 --> 00:27.368
If so, I would love for you
to take over the inn...

00:28.452 --> 00:29.494
An inn...

00:29.495 --> 00:30.995
Girlfriend...

00:30.996 --> 00:31.788
Mistress...

00:31.789 --> 00:33.666
Let's go back to the shop, you two.

00:36.710 --> 00:38.587
Man, such a cutie patootie.

00:38.796 --> 00:40.756
I can't believe she's Iori's sister.

00:41.173 --> 00:42.924
But why did she come so suddenly?

00:42.925 --> 00:45.677
Huh? Didn't I tell you yesterday?

00:45.678 --> 00:48.179
She had a hunch that Chisa
and Iori would get married,

00:48.180 --> 00:49.390
so she rushed over.

00:49.932 --> 00:52.351
Must be that sibling sixth sense.

00:52.560 --> 00:54.979
So there's a strong bond between them.

00:56.897 --> 00:58.566
Huh? What are you doing?

00:59.108 --> 01:02.570
I am also Shiori's big brother.
Which means...

01:02.820 --> 01:05.531
I too could also sense her.

01:09.285 --> 01:11.244
I want some alcohol.

01:11.245 --> 01:12.538
Not you!

01:13.205 --> 01:14.247
Inn...

01:14.248 --> 01:15.373
Girlfriend...

01:15.374 --> 01:16.542
Heir...

01:17.167 --> 01:21.964
If... if Iori and I did this and that...

01:22.756 --> 01:24.466
We'd take over the inn together...

01:24.675 --> 01:27.011
and I... I would become...

01:27.761 --> 01:28.678
the mistress...

01:28.679 --> 01:30.139
Not me!

01:31.891 --> 01:35.186
Still, to think she was worried
about Chisa-chan and Iori.

01:35.603 --> 01:37.980
Even though they live
under the same roof.

01:38.397 --> 01:40.691
She must be a worrywart.

01:41.567 --> 01:42.818
That's true.

01:43.319 --> 01:47.072
That's crazy if they are "cousins"
who are unrelated by blood.

01:49.033 --> 01:50.075
- Huh?
- Heh?

01:56.290 --> 01:59.918
Let's ride out into
the highway of our youth

01:59.919 --> 02:02.922
Right now is always
the best of the season

02:03.130 --> 02:06.674
Get high on hope,
as we adults keep winning

02:06.675 --> 02:10.136
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

02:10.137 --> 02:13.473
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

02:13.474 --> 02:15.559
Ever Endless

02:16.769 --> 02:18.437
Ever Endless

02:20.189 --> 02:21.732
Ever Endless

02:23.609 --> 02:24.985
Ever Endless

02:25.653 --> 02:30.448
Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety

02:30.449 --> 02:31.867
Ever Endless

02:32.284 --> 02:37.080
Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf

02:37.081 --> 02:38.665
Ever Endless

02:38.666 --> 02:40.083
All my limbs' been giving in

02:40.084 --> 02:41.918
Kalbi's a burden like my lumber spine

02:41.919 --> 02:43.503
Doing family service with irises dim

02:43.504 --> 02:45.130
But you know that I'll go all the way

02:45.548 --> 02:48.717
Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining

02:48.968 --> 02:52.554
Let's give it one more chance

02:52.555 --> 02:56.016
Let's ride out into
the highway of our youth

02:56.225 --> 02:59.019
Right now is always
the best of the season

02:59.228 --> 03:02.856
Get high on hope,
as we adults keep winning

03:02.857 --> 03:05.860
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

03:06.068 --> 03:08.236
Youth is when you never...

03:08.237 --> 03:09.737
stop chasing your own values

03:09.738 --> 03:11.406
Our youth's eternal

03:11.407 --> 03:12.991
the color never fades with age

03:12.992 --> 03:14.868
Youth is when you keep...

03:14.869 --> 03:16.411
getting lost along the way

03:16.412 --> 03:19.957
Youth is Forever

03:23.127 --> 03:23.919
Well then.

03:24.128 --> 03:26.672
I have something to take care of.

03:26.797 --> 03:27.297
Okay.

03:27.298 --> 03:28.340
Gotcha.

03:29.049 --> 03:31.426
The pest is finally gone.

03:31.427 --> 03:33.470
She's your cute little sister, though.

03:33.721 --> 03:36.390
But we can't drink naked
with her around, right?

03:36.724 --> 03:38.893
That should be the case with anyone.

03:40.060 --> 03:40.810
Really?

03:40.811 --> 03:43.521
I thought you were part
of the nudist gang.

03:43.522 --> 03:45.774
That's just because I've given up.

03:46.525 --> 03:48.861
Besides, Aina's here to get
upset at you guys now.

03:49.278 --> 03:50.487
Cakey, eh?

03:51.071 --> 03:53.866
She should try it once
before complaining.

03:54.116 --> 03:55.533
What are you talking about?

03:55.534 --> 03:58.579
There's no way a girl who's embarrassed
of using swimsuit would...

04:06.045 --> 04:06.795
Huh?

04:09.757 --> 04:12.175
Azusa-san, are you still
wearing your undies?!

04:12.176 --> 04:13.593
Get stripping already!

04:13.594 --> 04:14.928
Well said, Aina!

04:14.929 --> 04:16.305
Let's have a match!

04:18.390 --> 04:19.725
Huh? What's wrong?

04:20.142 --> 04:21.894
Something feels really off...

04:22.394 --> 04:24.396
What are you talking about...

04:28.317 --> 04:30.235
Words fail me.

04:30.236 --> 04:31.070
Right?

04:31.320 --> 04:33.905
What on earth happened
while we were gone?

04:33.906 --> 04:35.783
I have no idea.

04:35.991 --> 04:38.619
For now, let's go get some
coffee or something.

04:38.827 --> 04:40.496
You mean to kill time?

04:40.996 --> 04:43.999
When Cakey gets into that mood,
nothing good will come of it.

04:44.416 --> 04:45.417
True.

04:46.293 --> 04:49.004
So, do you know any café to recomm-

04:51.549 --> 04:53.759
Where are you two going?

04:54.134 --> 04:56.095
Nowhere, right, Chisa?

04:56.220 --> 04:57.053
Y-Yeah.

04:57.054 --> 04:59.265
Then hurry up and come inside.

04:59.557 --> 05:03.185
We're just about to get started
with rock-paper-stripper.

05:05.020 --> 05:07.898
Everyone, they're back!

05:09.400 --> 05:11.609
I don't know what happened,
but this is bad.

05:11.610 --> 05:13.946
Maybe she mistakenly drank
some strong alcohol?

05:16.949 --> 05:20.410
Are Iori and Chisa really
not related by blood?

05:20.411 --> 05:20.870
Yeah.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.328
Haven't I said it before?

05:22.329 --> 05:23.122
Wow.

05:23.539 --> 05:24.331
No way...

05:24.582 --> 05:26.333
There's no way...

05:27.418 --> 05:28.294
What's wrong?

05:28.419 --> 05:30.337
Why are you so distressed about?

05:30.462 --> 05:33.132
Because I thought
they were cousins, so I felt glad.

05:33.799 --> 05:36.302
If they're not related by blood...

05:36.802 --> 05:39.804
she might even already be pregnant!

05:39.805 --> 05:42.099
Okay, let's calm down, Aina.

05:42.391 --> 05:44.268
Why would she suddenly be pregnant?

05:44.518 --> 05:46.228
With those two, it's truly possible.

05:46.478 --> 05:48.104
Huh? Really?

05:48.105 --> 05:49.565
Don't worry.

05:49.857 --> 05:53.319
You can't say stuff like that in front
of her uncle-slash-father!

05:54.028 --> 05:54.945
What's important...

05:55.154 --> 05:57.823
is their feelings for each other
aren't tied to blood.

05:58.532 --> 06:00.784
That's true, but...

06:01.535 --> 06:04.747
I can't tell if they even have
feelings for each other.

06:05.080 --> 06:07.373
I don't think they're hiding anything.

06:07.374 --> 06:10.711
That's because they're hiding it so well.

06:12.046 --> 06:13.380
If that's the case...

06:14.882 --> 06:17.301
let me lend a hand in
finding out the truth.

06:17.760 --> 06:19.469
Is that okay, Kouhei?

06:19.470 --> 06:21.805
I cannot simply close my
eyes to this matter.

06:22.097 --> 06:25.099
Then let's work together to find out
how they really feel.

06:25.100 --> 06:25.684
Yeah!

06:26.352 --> 06:27.144
By the way,

06:27.394 --> 06:29.396
why are you trying to find this out?

06:30.397 --> 06:32.566
To maintain order in the club.

06:32.816 --> 06:33.901
Huh?

06:35.361 --> 06:37.154
Welcome home, you two.

06:37.321 --> 06:38.948
- Yeah.
- We're home.

06:39.490 --> 06:40.324
Well then,

06:40.616 --> 06:41.992
do you want Spirytus?

06:42.159 --> 06:43.619
Or rock-paper-stripper?

06:44.620 --> 06:47.623
Don't use such a sweet tone to
force hard choices on me.

06:47.748 --> 06:49.542
Aina, did something happen?

06:49.792 --> 06:51.377
You don't seem drunk.

06:52.169 --> 06:53.211
Nothing at all.

06:53.212 --> 06:55.922
These two probably won't
spill their feelings easily.

06:55.923 --> 06:58.926
So I'll get them drunk
and drag out the truth.

07:00.344 --> 07:02.887
I figured this kind of stuff is good
every now and then.

07:02.888 --> 07:03.931
So weird...

07:05.099 --> 07:06.475
You're thinking too much.

07:07.518 --> 07:10.020
Drinking and playing
rock-paper-stripper, huh?

07:10.521 --> 07:11.814
I don't mind.

07:11.981 --> 07:12.981
- Really?
- Huh?

07:12.982 --> 07:14.108
However,

07:17.820 --> 07:20.698
only if you can join in that state.

07:20.906 --> 07:22.867
So you're not gonna play?

07:23.742 --> 07:26.620
I don't know what you're doing,
but give it up.

07:28.122 --> 07:29.331
- Then...
- Then?

07:30.291 --> 07:32.000
Then, shall we begin?

07:32.001 --> 07:33.502
What?

07:33.878 --> 07:36.963
What are you trying to achieve
that you'd go so far?

07:36.964 --> 07:39.424
N-Nothing, this is just a swimsuit.

07:39.425 --> 07:41.551
This much isn't embarrassing at all.

07:41.552 --> 07:42.468
Did she hit her head?

07:42.469 --> 07:43.929
Maybe the makeup made her brain rot.

07:44.756 --> 07:46.264
They're on guard.

07:46.265 --> 07:47.391
Kouhei.

07:47.641 --> 07:49.143
Roger.

07:49.268 --> 07:50.477
Hey, Kitahara.

07:50.769 --> 07:52.605
I have a question for you.

07:52.730 --> 07:53.521
What is it?

07:53.522 --> 07:56.692
The other day, I was playing
a bishoujo game at home.

07:57.026 --> 08:01.362
In it, the cutest one was
the player's relative.

08:01.363 --> 08:01.988
Nice!

08:01.989 --> 08:05.367
Sneaking it into a story about games.
Good job, Kouhei!

08:05.993 --> 08:06.784
And?

08:06.785 --> 08:11.332
I want to hear your opinion on
romances between family members.

08:12.333 --> 08:14.876
Kitahara, what do you really think...

08:14.877 --> 08:16.503
about Shiori-chan?

08:16.879 --> 08:17.754
She's my sister.

08:17.755 --> 08:19.173
Not that one!

08:20.174 --> 08:23.092
We know Shiori-chan is
actually his sister, right?

08:23.093 --> 08:25.512
That's exactly why he might be into it.

08:25.513 --> 08:28.098
No! No normal person would...

08:28.807 --> 08:30.309
NORMAL PERSON
Heh?

08:30.893 --> 08:33.312
- Let's confirm just in case.
- Yeah.

08:33.729 --> 08:34.480
Huh?

08:34.813 --> 08:36.524
Your turn, Azusa-san.

08:36.774 --> 08:38.108
Got it.

08:39.109 --> 08:40.486
The Impression Game?

08:40.986 --> 08:41.819
Exactly.

08:41.820 --> 08:43.738
The person who's "it" gives a topic,

08:43.739 --> 08:46.867
and everyone points to the person
who fits that impression.

08:46.992 --> 08:48.285
Sounds nice and simple.

08:48.661 --> 08:50.579
It's just a drinking game, after all.

08:51.163 --> 08:53.666
It's great for playing
while being drunk.

08:53.916 --> 08:56.167
It's nice to mix it up
every once in a while.

08:56.168 --> 08:58.420
We've played rock-paper-stripper
everyday.

08:58.794 --> 08:59.713
True...

09:00.811 --> 09:02.229
Then let's begin.

09:02.771 --> 09:04.023
Impression Game!

09:04.565 --> 09:05.982
Yeah!

09:05.983 --> 09:08.485
The topic is "someone
would look good in green."

09:08.486 --> 09:10.195
Yeah!

09:10.196 --> 09:11.364
Ready, set, go!

09:13.360 --> 09:16.028
Huh? I look good in green?

09:16.029 --> 09:16.862
You do, you do.

09:16.863 --> 09:18.739
It's from your hoodie and shirt.

09:18.740 --> 09:20.033
You're a green horn.

09:20.158 --> 09:22.576
Then Iori gets the penalty.

09:22.577 --> 09:24.037
Geez, fine.

09:24.705 --> 09:26.747
So, is it going to be beer or sawa?

09:26.748 --> 09:27.374
Nope.

09:27.582 --> 09:29.126
Not that kind of thing today.

09:29.459 --> 09:30.460
Just this water.

09:32.295 --> 09:33.087
Water?

09:33.088 --> 09:34.047
Just water.

09:37.134 --> 09:39.428
It's really just water.

09:40.429 --> 09:41.221
I see.

09:42.597 --> 09:43.306
WATER

09:44.766 --> 09:46.559
Are you okay? Want some water?

09:46.560 --> 09:48.437
As long as it's not flammable.

09:48.812 --> 09:51.648
Since Iori lost, he gets
to pick the next topic.

09:52.315 --> 09:53.400
Understood.

09:53.900 --> 09:56.528
Any impression is fine
for the topic, right?

09:56.737 --> 09:57.529
That's right.

09:58.405 --> 09:59.239
Well then,

10:00.032 --> 10:01.115
Impression Game!

10:01.116 --> 10:01.742
Yeah!

10:02.534 --> 10:05.037
The topic is "someone who
might be into long baths."

10:05.537 --> 10:06.538
Ready, go!

10:08.582 --> 10:09.374
Huh?

10:09.791 --> 10:10.583
You think so?

10:10.584 --> 10:13.169
Iori gives off that kind vibe.

10:13.170 --> 10:16.297
Yeah, he looks like he takes ages
to wash himself.

10:16.298 --> 10:17.132
I suppose so.

10:17.382 --> 10:18.674
Here, your penalty.

10:18.675 --> 10:20.177
Oh, right.

10:21.928 --> 10:23.429
To avoid a three-loss streak,

10:23.430 --> 10:27.559
I'll play dirty and single out
one person this time.

10:27.934 --> 10:29.185
Impression Game!

10:29.186 --> 10:29.895
Yeah!

10:30.395 --> 10:31.188
The topic is...

10:31.438 --> 10:33.982
"the person who seems
the most like an otaku."

10:34.608 --> 10:35.567
Ready, go!

10:36.318 --> 10:37.361
Why?

10:37.736 --> 10:40.238
Isn't it weird to choose me when he's here?

10:40.739 --> 10:42.198
That's not true at all.

10:42.199 --> 10:45.744
Well, I may look like this,
but I was once an otaku.

10:45.952 --> 10:47.703
Are you saying that for real?

10:47.704 --> 10:50.331
Well, you know, it's the impression game.

10:50.332 --> 10:52.666
It's who "seems like,"
not who "actually is."

10:52.667 --> 10:53.919
Huh? "Actually is"?

10:55.170 --> 10:56.754
So that's how it is.

10:56.755 --> 10:57.839
Here, your penalty.

11:00.258 --> 11:02.427
Fine by me. Bring it on.

11:02.594 --> 11:03.594
You're fired up.

11:03.595 --> 11:05.304
As expected of Iori.

11:05.305 --> 11:08.891
This time, I'll go with something
that applies to anyone but me.

11:08.892 --> 11:11.102
Impression Game!

11:11.103 --> 11:12.020
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

11:13.063 --> 11:15.732
Hey! I haven't even said anything yet.

11:16.108 --> 11:17.567
Oh, is that so?

11:17.901 --> 11:19.777
My hand moved like it's sentient.

11:19.778 --> 11:22.030
Does that mean this round is void?

11:22.322 --> 11:24.240
Don't sweat the small stuff.

11:24.241 --> 11:26.952
Only sore losers complain.

11:27.828 --> 11:29.787
It's frustrating,
but you've got the point.

11:29.788 --> 11:30.705
I don't think they do.

11:30.706 --> 11:32.916
Since it's come to this, I'll go all out.

11:33.166 --> 11:34.333
Nice one, Iori.

11:34.334 --> 11:35.335
That's a man for you!

11:36.086 --> 11:37.129
Gotcha!

11:37.379 --> 11:40.132
Now I just need to wait
for Iori to get drunk.

11:41.466 --> 11:42.509
Drink!

11:43.135 --> 11:44.219
Hey, Iori.

11:44.845 --> 11:45.637
Yeah?

11:45.846 --> 11:48.140
Why do you look so sober?

11:49.016 --> 11:51.350
What, you didn't notice?

11:51.351 --> 11:52.436
Huh, what?

11:52.853 --> 11:55.271
This is really just plain water.

11:55.272 --> 11:56.147
What?

11:56.148 --> 11:58.233
No way, I swear I...

11:58.734 --> 11:59.901
Just kidding.

12:02.904 --> 12:05.907
I just pretended to drink
and spilled most of it.

12:08.869 --> 12:10.078
ALCOHOL STAINS AFTER EVAPORATION

12:14.833 --> 12:16.168
Phew, geez.

12:16.334 --> 12:17.501
Oh, good job.

12:17.502 --> 12:19.629
Seriously, I'm beat.

12:20.547 --> 12:22.966
So what was that all about?

12:23.884 --> 12:24.968
The truth is...

12:26.428 --> 12:28.180
So that's what it was.

12:28.930 --> 12:31.265
My dad's adopted is all.

12:31.266 --> 12:34.311
So, what do you think
about Chisa-chan?

12:34.436 --> 12:35.228
Yeah.

12:35.854 --> 12:37.773
It's hard to explain.

12:38.523 --> 12:40.900
I suppose she's like a friend my age.

12:40.901 --> 12:41.526
Oh.

12:42.444 --> 12:44.988
So it never really clicked, you know.

12:45.655 --> 12:46.655
Is that so?

12:46.656 --> 12:49.368
Then, could Azusa and Nanaka-san
be different then?

12:49.576 --> 12:51.995
Well, they are my friends too, of course.

12:52.537 --> 12:53.830
But those two...

12:54.164 --> 12:56.624
are more like older sisters.

12:56.625 --> 12:57.417
Hm.

12:57.667 --> 12:59.179
Which is why, to be honest...

12:59.586 --> 13:01.838
even though we're cousins,
I find Nanaka-san...

13:01.963 --> 13:02.505
I'm home...

13:02.506 --> 13:03.965
to be pretty sexy.

13:04.257 --> 13:05.299
now.

13:05.300 --> 13:06.259
Huh?

13:08.970 --> 13:11.931
Uh... Nanaka-san, that was just...

13:11.932 --> 13:14.934
Uh... Uhm, sorry, Iori-kun.

13:14.935 --> 13:15.936
I have to...

13:16.395 --> 13:18.605
call a friend.

13:21.858 --> 13:24.360
That's not it!

13:24.361 --> 13:25.821
Look, Nanaka.

13:26.029 --> 13:28.615
Boys that age are like that.

13:29.324 --> 13:32.035
I meant in comparison to Chisa!

13:32.369 --> 13:34.036
Well, stop crying.

13:34.037 --> 13:36.373
You'll make up with her eventually.

13:36.998 --> 13:38.333
That's not it!

13:39.167 --> 13:41.378
That's not what I meant!

13:45.340 --> 13:46.132
YOSHIWARA

13:46.133 --> 13:47.801
Your fever has gone down.

13:48.260 --> 13:49.052
Thanks.

13:49.845 --> 13:51.972
Because you fell asleep
dressed like that.

13:52.723 --> 13:53.515
Ugh...

13:53.849 --> 13:54.933
How embarrassing.

13:55.684 --> 13:57.936
Sorry, I know you're supposed
to watch the shop.

13:58.228 --> 14:00.147
The manager isn't around, is he?

14:00.564 --> 14:04.442
It's okay, my sister is there,
and dad will be back soon.

14:04.443 --> 14:06.737
I left Iori there too for good measure.

14:07.154 --> 14:07.946
I see.

14:08.613 --> 14:12.576
That idiot is probably happy about
being alone with Nanaka-san.

14:14.453 --> 14:17.122
Nice weather, isn't it, Nanaka-san?

14:17.831 --> 14:18.623
You're right.

14:19.082 --> 14:22.753
It's probably hot outside since the sun
is so bright, right, Nanaka-san?

14:23.503 --> 14:24.337
You're right.

14:25.380 --> 14:26.506
Uhm, Nanaka-san.

14:26.757 --> 14:28.966
Yes, Iori-kun?

14:28.967 --> 14:31.136
Won't you sit a little closer?

14:32.054 --> 14:34.597
I've been fond of this sofa recently.

14:34.598 --> 14:35.932
Is that so?

14:36.224 --> 14:39.728
Damn it, to think that one sentence
